<title>USA: Symetrics Industries Inc Q4 net increases.</title>
<headline>Symetrics Industries Inc Q4 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.18		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			    290			224</p>
<p> Revs			 4,540		    4,870</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			  1,756		    1,051</p>
<p> Revs			23,174		   22,097</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal 1997 includes a one-time gain of $370,523, or $0.23 per share.</p>
<p>The company said all figures include the consolidation of the revenues and net income of Ameican Digital Switching which it acquired in April 1996.</p>
